INTEGRATING ROBOTICS IN SCIENCE EDUCATION

In science classes, robotics can be used to demonstrate concept like motion, energy, electricity, and automation.
  ex. Arduiono-based projects using sensors and motors allow students to observe scientific principles in action

  Science Concepts
    -Motion (Speed, Velocity, Acceleration)
    -Energy (Kinetic and Potential Energy)
    -Electricity (Circuits, Voltage, Current)
    -Automation (Sensors, Motors, and Control)


